MASTER BUILD SPECIFICATION — BRISK SMART CONNECT

1. PROJECT OVERVIEW

Build BRISK Smart Connect, a complete, production-oriented, multi-tenant WiFi hotspot management and ISP billing SaaS platform.

The platform must support multiple independent router owners, their customers, multiple physical routers and access points, captive portals, M-Pesa payments, vouchers, WhatsApp messaging, subscriptions, reporting and centralized administration.

This is an original BRISK Smart Connect product. Do not copy another company's branding, source code or proprietary interface.

Build a real full-stack application, not a static website or frontend-only demo.

