Mark the entitlement active only when the activation workflow has reached the appropriate confirmed state.

Retry temporary network failures safely.

Notify the customer of the result.

Record the operation and any error.

If payment succeeds but the router is offline, preserve the confirmed payment, mark activation as pending, alert the owner and retry safely. Do not charge the customer again automatically.

When a package expires, remove or restrict authorization according to the configured rules.

